{% include "@components/navigation-prototypes/navbar-oisp.twig" %}

<main>
<section>
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="cell small-12 large-12">
                <h2>Industry &amp; Partnership Engagement</h2>
                <p>The Office of Innovation &amp; Strategic Partnerships works with industry leaders, entrepreneurs, investors, and subject matter experts to advance UT San Antonio innovations toward real-world impact. Through a variety of engagement opportunities, OISP connects external expertise with faculty innovation to strengthen development, inform strategy, and accelerate commercialization.</p>
                <h2>Ways to Engage</h2>
                <p>OISP offers multiple pathways for industry and entrepreneurial leaders to engage with the university — whether through mentorship, advisory roles, program participation, or strategic collaboration.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bleed beige">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h3>Workshop Subject Matter Experts</h3>
                    <p>OISP regularly engages industry professionals as guest speakers and subject matter experts within its commercialization and startup education programs.</p>
                    <p>These engagements provide faculty and research teams with real-world perspectives while offering experts an opportunity to contribute to innovation education and ecosystem development.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button" aria-label="Express interest in Workshop Subject Matter Experts">Express Interest</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h3>Strategic Alliances &amp; Partnerships</h3>
                    <p>OISP builds and manages strategic relationships with external partners to advance institutional priorities, expand innovation pathways, and support commercialization and programmatic goals.</p>
                    <p>Through collaborative partnerships, OISP works to align university innovation with industry needs, shared objectives, and long-term impact opportunities.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button" aria-label="Express interest in Strategic Alliances and Partnerships">Express Interest</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h3>Key Opinion Leader (KOL) Network</h3>
                    <p>Aligned with OISP’s goal of advancing innovations toward patient and societal benefit, the KOL Network is comprised of industry, clinical, and venture professionals who bring real-world perspective to emerging technologies.</p>
                    <p>KOLs share subject matter expertise, market insight, and strategic feedback to help assess opportunity potential, inform development direction, and strengthen pathways to commercialization.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button">Become a Key Opinion Leader</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h3>Entrepreneur-in-Resident (EIR) Program</h3>
                    <p>OISP’s Entrepreneur-in-Resident Program connects experienced entrepreneurs with faculty innovations to support the translation of research into market-ready solutions.</p>
                    <p>Entrepreneurs-in-Resident collaborate with faculty teams to assess commercial strategy, refine value propositions, and guide early venture development — while faculty remain in their academic roles.</p>
                    <p>This program offers entrepreneurs a unique opportunity to engage with cutting-edge research, contribute expertise, and help shape the next generation of innovation.</p>
                    <p>Through collaborative partnerships, OISP works to align university innovation with industry needs, shared objectives, and long-term impact opportunities.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button">Become an Entrepreneur-in-Resident</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</main>

